{"id":"n56750-1-9","stage":3,"title":"반값 · 半价","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56750-1-9-1","ko":"새 옷이네! 언제 샀어?","zh":"新衣服啊！什么时候买的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새","meaning":"新的","explanation":"새：新的","readings":[{"term":"새","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17884","senseId":"2","lemma":"새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷이네!","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"샀어?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e2d38c50201cf36d","term":"새","zh":"新的","audio":"/audio/e2d38c50201cf36dbda0.mp3","entryId":"17884","definition":"出现或被制作没多久的。","pronunciation":["새"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"不知道的某时。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9a49afc1a8c3fde5f708.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56750-1-9-2","ko":"어제 반값으로 세일하더라고. 그래서 평소보다 싸게 샀어.","zh":"昨天在打折，半价出售呢。所以才比平时更便宜地买到了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반값으로","meaning":"半价，五折","explanation":"반값：半价，五折；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"반값","audio":"/audio/80dcfd9fac3e8d2bf81b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56750","senseId":"1","lemma":"반값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세일하더라고.","meaning":"减价，打折","explanation":"세일하다：减价，打折；더라고：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"세일하다","audio":"/audio/18b046012f073c5eb356.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63569","senseId":"1","lemma":"세일하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"평소보다","meaning":"平常，平时，平日","explanation":"평소：平常，平时，平日；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"평소","audio":"/audio/ebf09ee6c46b848f6558.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71341","senseId":"1","lemma":"평소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싸게","meaning":"便宜，贱","explanation":"싸다：便宜，贱；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29718","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"샀어.","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"80dc